    "normal/dual": "existing advanced tapes exercise 9mm real shots, accepted removed magazine(s), authoritative settled loaded/reserve/escrow and native capability; no complete insertion/recovery coverage",
    "normal magazine families": "declared SingleWeaponPath setup admits 9mm, AR15 and Thompson through ordinary stock grant/draw and paid-magazine support checks; reuses the existing normal tape with unchanged readiness and conservation assertions"
  },
  "gaps": [
    "No existing native tape targets magwell insertion, loose-mag hand/Alyx recovery, pouch accounting, or exact manual rack geometry across catalogs",
    "Only 9mm normal/paired, AR15 and Thompson are exposed by the bounded preparer; catalog enumeration does not establish runtime coverage for other mechanisms",
    "Existing hold observer intentionally fails on identity switching or ammo increase, so cannot serve as complete reload/lifecycle observer unchanged",
    "No existing capture/effect assertion proves visible live-vs-spent ejection, port transform or action audio; source finding is not rendered reproduction",
    "Rev40 includes local toss/catch, but the existing hold tape does not exercise release/catch or lifecycle transitions; those remain unmeasured",
    "Standalone observer does not validate Host/Join authority, true map travel, or headset feel"
